{"4779530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HARDcheologist", "steam_appid": 4779530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>HARDcheologist</strong>, you must explore a mysterious pyramid and survive a series of ruins filled with all kind of dangers using only your weapon and your abilities as you descend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control your fall using your weapon's recoil</strong>. Reload by landing shots or touching the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each level of the pyramid will present different challenges</strong>, each with its own unique aesthetic, mechanics, enemies, traps, and secrets. As you descend, the dangers will increase. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run will be different: shoot gems, increase your combo and speed, try out different weapons and abilities, unearth relics, discover secrets... <strong>How deep will you be able to go? Can you uncover the mystery hidden within this strange pyramid? Will you be able to find the exit?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reload, increase your combo and speed by chaining shots</strong> without touching the ground.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast runs</strong>: die, learn by exploring, try again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Procedurally generated levels</strong>, each with its own unique aesthetic and hazards. No two descents will be the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different weapons, abilities, and upgrades</strong> to unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique style, with different color palettes and backgrounds as you descend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden secrets</strong> along the way and <strong>a great mystery to unravel</strong>.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>HARDcheologist</strong>, you must explore a mysterious pyramid and survive a series of ruins filled with all kind of dangers using only your weapon and your abilities as you descend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control your fall using your weapon's recoil</strong>. Reload by landing shots or touching the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each level of the pyramid will present different challenges</strong>, each with its own unique aesthetic, mechanics, enemies, traps, and secrets. As you descend, the dangers will increase. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run will be different: shoot gems, increase your combo and speed, try out different weapons and abilities, unearth relics, discover secrets... <strong>How deep will you be able to go? Can you uncover the mystery hidden within this strange pyramid? Will you be able to find the exit?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reload, increase your combo and speed by chaining shots</strong> without touching the ground.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast runs</strong>: die, learn by exploring, try again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Procedurally generated levels</strong>, each with its own unique aesthetic and hazards. No two descents will be the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different weapons, abilities, and upgrades</strong> to unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique style, with different color palettes and backgrounds as you descend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden secrets</strong> along the way and <strong>a great mystery to unravel</strong>.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Yo